<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Fungoid apocalypse-->
  <VRE_FungoidApocalypse>蕈类启示录</VRE_FungoidApocalypse>
  <!--EN: With this mod option enabled, ALL incoming humanoid raids will be fungoids!-->
  <VRE_FungoidApocalypseDesc>启用此 mod 选项后，所有传入的人形突袭都将是真菌！</VRE_FungoidApocalypseDesc>
  <!--EN: Gene infected ({0} days)-->
  <VRE_InfectedLabel>基因感染（{0} 天）</VRE_InfectedLabel>
  <!--EN: Gene infection chance-->
  <VRE_InfectionChance>基因感染几率</VRE_InfectionChance>
  <!--EN: Chance of the gene infection to infect the target. By default it is 20%. Bear in mind this only applies to claw and teeth attacks, if the person with a gene infector gene carries melee weapons this will reduce infection chances.-->
  <VRE_InfectionChanceDesc>基因感染感染目标的机会。默认情况下为 20%。请记住，这仅适用于爪子和牙齿攻击，如果带有基因感染者基因的人携带近战武器，这将减少感染机会。</VRE_InfectionChanceDesc>
  <!--EN: Infection caused by the contact with a {0}. Upon reaching 100%, colonist will turn into a {0}-->
  <VRE_InfectionDescription>因接触 {0} 引起的感染。达到 100% 后，殖民者将变成 {0}</VRE_InfectionDescription>
  <!--EN: Gene infection ({0}), {1}-->
  <VRE_InfectionLabel>基因感染（{0}）、{1}</VRE_InfectionLabel>
  <!--EN: Reset-->
  <VRE_Reset>重置</VRE_Reset>
  <!--EN: Repulsive colonist!-->
  <VRE_TextMote_RepulsiveColonist>可恶的殖民者！</VRE_TextMote_RepulsiveColonist>
